<p>ibn-e raza bhi saalike raahe raza rahaa<br />
sajjada-e rasool pe shaghle dua rahaa<br />
har ranj me zabaan pa shukr-e khuda rahaa<br />
ginti ke dostdaar the dushman hazaarhaa</p>

<p>badh khwaah kitne is qamar-e murtuza ke the<br />
tha ek chiraagh sainkdo jhonke hawa ke the<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kya haal ho razaa ke jigar band ka bayaa'n<br />
pyaara tha murtuza ka wo sultan-e ins-o jaa'n<br />
moujiz numa imaam-e zama'n haadiye jahaa'n<br />
aise wali ke dar paye eezaa the badh-gumaa'n</p>

<p>souz-e alam se dil me the chaale pade huwe<br />
the rashke gul ko jaan ke laale pade huwe<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>laanath quda ki motasim e naabekaar par<br />
bheja payaam chodiye ghar aayiye udhar<br />
darpesh aah phir huwa baghdaad ka safar<br />
par is safar ne manzil-e aaqir ki di qabar</p>

<p>mazloom ka ye kooch watan se aqeer tha<br />
mushtaaq-e kanj qabr ka wo goshageer tha<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>hamraah umme fazl bhi thi moride azaab<br />
yasrab se jaane ki thi qushi isko be hisaab<br />
uska chacha tha motasim-e qaanumaa&rsquo;n qaraab<br />
baghdaad me pahonch gaye shaah-e falak janaab</p>

<p>touqeer zaaheri to bahut bewafaa ne ki<br />
par fikr-e qatl-e shaah is ahl-e jafaa ne ki<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>baghdaad me muqeem rahe saal bhar huzoor<br />
naari ye chaahta tha ke gul ho charaagh-e noor<br />
waaqif tha umme fazl ki haalat se pur futoor<br />
rakhti thi bughz rahbar-e aalam se be shaoor</p>

<p>zaalim ke mashvare se wo qarsand hogayi<br />
kehne pe motasim ke raza mand hogayi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye be murawwati ye sitam ye ghazab ye qahar<br />
wo bekasi imaam ki wo door apna shaher<br />
dekhe to ahle dil qalash e qaar baagh-e dahar<br />
angoor raazaqi me diya faaqakash ko zehar</p>

<p>li karwate'n ali-o wali ko pukaar ke<br />
eezaa-e paak sooj gaye dil figaar ke<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>rone lagi wo dekh ke hazrat ka haal-e zaar<br />
farmaaya aap ne ke abas hai to ashkbaar<br />
is aarze se degaa sazaa tujhko kirdegaar<br />
jis ka koi ilaaj nahi aye jafaa shiyaar</p>

<p>deti jawaab kya sar-e mal'oona jhuk gaya<br />
dam shaahe dee'n ka zaher ke sadmou se ruk gaya<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>takleef payi chand shab-o roz jaa'n gasal<br />
taasir-e sam se aag thi seene me mushta'al<br />
wo karb wo jigar ki haraarat wo dard-e dil<br />
hota gaya rasool ka dildaar muzmahil</p>

<p>haakim ne ki madad na tawajjo tabeeb ne<br />
aaqir safar kiya suwe jannat ghareeb ne<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kumbhla ke rehgaya gule tar buturaab ka<br />
murjhaya nounehaal risaalat ma'aab ka<br />
dekha jawaane marg ne rang inqilaab ka<br />
wo maut bekasi ki wo mausam shabaab ka</p>

<p>kyu peer e charq jaaye taa saf hai ya nahi<br />
kamsin imaamo'n me koi aisa huwa nahi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>anjaam is tarha bhi kitaabo'n me hai raqam<br />
shiyo'n ne aap ke jo suna ye naya sitam<br />
rote huwe gaye sar-e tasleem karke qam<br />
mayyat ko behre ghusl uthaya ba chashme nam</p>

<p>seeno'n ko apne qasta jigar peetne lage<br />
amaame phaink phaink ke sar peetne lage<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>nahlaaya is musaafir-e daarus salaam ko<br />
bhar aaye dil kafan jo pinhaaya imaam ko<br />
taaboot me litaake shah-e qaas-o aam ko<br />
pursa diya ali ko rasool-e anaam ko</p>

<p>naale tawaaf karte the arshe majeed ka<br />
maatam kiya uthaake janaaza shaheed ka<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>jis jaa thi qabr moosiye kaazim falak weqaar<br />
pehlu me is lahad ke quda doosra mazaar<br />
posheeda zer-e qaak huwa noor-e kirdegaar<br />
hasrat pukaar ti thi ke is shaan ke nisaar</p>

<p>taaqeere dafn se bhi sharaf aashkaar hai<br />
ye waaris-e hussain ghareeb ud dayaar hai<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>